:INFO
Art. 134a Coordination with the European Union
The FOEN shall support the European Commission in accordance with Article 11 of the ETS Agreement. In particular it shall transmit to it the information required for this purpose.
|

:NOTE
Art. 134a — Inserted by No I of the O of 13 Nov. 2019, in force since 1 Jan. 2020 (AS 2019 4335).
SR 0.814.011.268
